# An X session on Dolly's display: the Xsdl server, twm managing the
# windows, and three of X's own clients in theirs: a clock, eyes that follow
# the pointer and a terminal with a shell, where imgui-x11 starts Dear ImGui's
# example in a window of its own.
FROM /v0.1.4/Dollyfile-system e89f4989b774937a794c31384b90d18851243256a146ebc05e58e3dd047aa946
INSTALL /v0.1.4/demos/x11/Dollyfile-xorg-server 4a2de90d4f424ba3cd56da8ca97e617ffa367f8942cd93f770b04a94938aae49
INSTALL /v0.1.4/demos/x11/Dollyfile-twm e335d2415141a96d4c4b1058cfdc3047bfe8f4f4555cb577d5e0d06ba0e8c795
INSTALL /v0.1.4/demos/x11/Dollyfile-xclock 99b5649cfd852147c8c8520015420b6ff63b89f685d41a7a2a65c0ed57719175
INSTALL /v0.1.4/demos/x11/Dollyfile-xeyes f274454e94aabe30925a92fa75654197ed0d71b0ef53b7bd283df566df7003d5
